~ start
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0, 100.0), 1.0, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az laugh: [font_size=70]Fenn!! [wave freq=7 amp=30]You did it![/wave][/font_size]
Fenn: Are you guys okay?
Az: We're good. Few scratches, nothing bad.
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]Oh [i]Post...[/i] I can not [shake level=7 rate=30]believeth[/shake] I-[wait=0.3] [i]ugh...[/i][/font_size]
Fenn worry: What's wrong?
Winston grit: [font_size=70]I'm the [shake level=10 rate=50][i]WORST![/i][/shake][/font_size] [wait=0.3][font_size=50]Tis what's wrong.[/font_size] 
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]I hath [i]failed.[/i][/font_size]
Fenn worry: [font_size=60][i]What?![/i][/font_size] What are you talking about?
Winston grit: [speed=1.2]I can't do [i]anything[/i] right. I hath tried [i]ambushing thee[/i]. I threweth [i]minions[/i] thy way.
Winston grit: [speed=1.2][font_size=60]I hath even [shake level=10 rate=40][i]cloned[/i] myself[/shake], [/font_size][font_size=70][wait=0.3]something I knoweth [i]VERY[/i] well, [/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=40]and nothing worked.[/font_size]
Winston: [speed=0.5][font_size=30]Tis broken. Tis all broken.[/font_size]
Winston: [speed=0.7][font_size=40]I do not hath anything left. Thou hast won. Congratulations, Fenn.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: Wh- [wait=0.3] why are you being so mean?
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]What?[/font_size]
Fenn worry: You're being really mean to yourself. 
Fenn: [wave freq=7 amp=30]I had fun today![/wave] I think that's more important.
Winston: Y- [wait=0.3]you did?
Fenn starry: It was fun! [wait=0.3]Right, [color="B80006"]Az[/color]?
Az: I mean,[wait=0.3] your creations were pretty cool.
Winston: Wait... really?
Az laugh: Yeah. And my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color] looked even [i]cleaner[/i] than usual.
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]Well... twas kind of a low bar...[/font_size]
Az laugh: [font_size=60]HAH, [wait=0.3]yeah, [wait=0.3]you right.[/font_size]
Az: You managed to make [i]all that[/i] with the scraps I had lying around?
Winston awkward: Oh-[wait=0.3] I am sorry! [wait=0.3]I can return thy parts!
Az: Nah man, it's all good. It's only fair. You kinda saved me with the inhaler.
Winston awkward: Oh, well, [wait=0.3]I saweth a few in thy [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]. 
Winston awkward: I didn't- [wait=0.3][font_size=40]I mean- [wait=0.3]I didn't wanteth thee to- [/font_size][font_size=30][wait=0.3]to die.[/font_size]
Az: Hey, at least you [font_size=60][i]DID[/i][/font_size] something today. 
Az annoy: [shake level=7 rate=30]I just sat around and waited for Fenn![/shake]
Fenn worry: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30][i]That's not true![/i][/shake] I had your bangle.[/font_size]
Fenn starry: I couldn't have gotten around [i]without[/i] it!
Winston: [font_size=40]Those bangles art,[wait=0.3] liketh,[wait=0.3] super cool.[/font_size]
Winston awkward: And t- [wait=0.3]thou also saved me from, uh,[font_size=40] from I- [wait=0.3]Iceton. [/font_size][font_size=30]So... thanks.[/font_size]
Az: Eh, [wait=0.3]you should be thanking Fenn. He convinced me to get over myself and help.
Fenn starry: [font_size=60]Yeah! If you died, [wave freq=10 amp=20]who else would make cool icy things?[/wave][/font_size]
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]Hah... I do not knoweth. I suppose.[/font_size]
Winston awkward: Art we-[wait=0.3] [font_size=40]art we good?[/font_size]
Az: Yeah. Help me free my [color="B80006"]Baba[/color],[wait=0.3] and we're good.
Winston awkward: Ah, [wait=0.3]of course.
Az: Fenn, meet us back in the [color="0B4F4A"]Great Hall[/color], 'kay?
do CutsceneManager.fade_to_black()
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Az")
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Winston")
do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("15-AzWs-ReachSafety-GreatHall", true)
=> END


~ breakseal
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(10112.0, -2000), 1.0, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CutsceneManager.create_npc("Az", Vector2(9300.0,-1152.0))
do CutsceneManager.create_npc("Winston", Vector2(9800.0,-1152.0))
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","right")
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Winston","right")
Fenn: [wave freq=7 amp=30]I'm here![/wave]
Az: Alright, get to it, nerd.
do CutsceneManager.fade_to_black()
#do CutsceneManager.play_sound("Icy magic")
do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
Winston: All done!
Winston awkward: Though... tis not much help without the other [color="8A0194"]Wizards[/color].
Fenn: Where could I find them?
Winston: I believe I saw [color="B80006"]Randy[/color] headeth towards the [color="0B4F4A"]Kitchen[/color],[wait=0.3] but tis all I knoweth. I am sorry.
Fenn starry: Well, [wait=0.3]to the [color="0B4F4A"]Kitchen[/color]!
Fenn: End of Demo! 
Fenn starry: Thanks for playing Leaves of Fate!
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("winston_seal_broken", true)
=> END